---
import { TextSection } from '@components/odyssey-theme';
import Layout from '../../layouts/Page.astro';

const seo = {
  title: `Internal Tools | Playing It Forward`,
  description: `Internal resource hub for Playing It Forward collective members — financial tracking, invoices, and legal compliance.`,
};
---

<Layout seo={seo}>
  <TextSection narrow>
    <h1>Internal Tools</h1>

    <p>This page is for collective members and core team use. It contains links and placeholders for financial records, invoices, and legal compliance documentation as the summer circuit operates.</p>

    <h2>Financial Spreadsheets</h2>

    <p><strong>Status:</strong> Placeholder — add link to shared Google Sheet or equivalent before first show.</p>

    <p>The financial spreadsheet should track:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Per-show revenue (door, flat fee, tips)</li>
      <li>Expenses (transport, gear, permits if applicable)</li>
      <li>Charitable disbursements (amount, recipient, date)</li>
      <li>Running totals for the summer circuit</li>
    </ul>

    <p><em>Link: [INSERT GOOGLE SHEETS / AIRTABLE URL HERE]</em></p>

    <h2>Invoices</h2>

    <p><strong>Status:</strong> Placeholder — establish a standard invoice template before billing venues.</p>

    <p>Invoice records should include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Venue name and contact</li>
      <li>Show date, location, and set duration</li>
      <li>Agreed payment amount and method</li>
      <li>Payment status (pending / received)</li>
    </ul>

    <p><em>Invoice folder: [INSERT GOOGLE DRIVE / NOTION / FILE STORAGE LINK HERE]</em></p>

    <h2>Legal Compliance</h2>

    <p><strong>Status:</strong> Placeholder — review requirements before operating in each city/venue type.</p>

    <p>Relevant compliance areas to track:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Business Registration:</strong> Confirm whether the collective needs to register as a DBA, LLC, or similar entity.</li>
      <li><strong>Performance Permits:</strong> Some cities (SF, Berkeley, San Jose) require permits for amplified street performance. Check requirements per location.</li>
      <li><strong>Charitable Solicitation:</strong> If collecting donations publicly, review California fundraising disclosure requirements.</li>
      <li><strong>Venue Contracts:</strong> Maintain copies of any written agreements with venues.</li>
      <li><strong>Liability Waivers:</strong> Keep waivers on file for any shows in public spaces.</li>
    </ul>

    <p><em>Compliance log: [INSERT NOTION / GOOGLE DOC URL HERE]</em></p>

    <h2>Core Team</h2>

    <p>Primary contacts for operations and decisions: <strong>Vivan, Abhee, Ayaan, Shashank.</strong></p>

    <p>For questions about this page or access to internal documents, reach out to the core team directly.</p>
  </TextSection>
</Layout>